        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>EZGrab 18 Inch White Grab Bar</b>\r\n<p>\r\n18\" long x 1-1/2\" diameter white grab bar made from 18 gauge stainless steel. These premium grade white finish grab rails exceed building code requirements.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EZGrab-GB18-WHSS_size.gif?v=1704442278\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"EZGrab 18 Inch White Grab Bar\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available other White <a href=\"/collections/grab-bars\"><b>EZGrab Grab Bars</b></a>: <a href=\"/products/12-inch-white-grab-bar\"><b>12 Inch White Grab Bar</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/24-inch-white-grab-bar\"><b>24 Inch White Grab Bar</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/36-inch-white-grab-bar\"><b>36 Inch White Grab Bar</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nExceeds ADA criteria and designed to exceed 250 lbs of load force when properly installed. Concealed screw mounting for a clean installation. Packaged with six (6) #12 x 2-1/2\" stainless steel screws and plastic anchors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for EZGrab 18 Inch White Grab Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length, Center to Center Mounting: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 21-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Tube Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>White</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<b>This item is Discontinued</b> See available <a href=\"/collections/grab-bars\">Grab Bars</a>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
